# Agent research notes and fact-check reports behind the content hub.
# Kept on disk as provenance for how claims are worded, deliberately not
# committed: they are working notes, not shipped content, and they carry
# em dashes that would trip the fleet dash gate on every future commit.
.drafts/*.factcheck.md
.drafts/page-pattern.md
.drafts/calculators.md
.drafts/news-facts.md
# Drafts still carrying unresolved fact-check corrections. Each is added here
# only once its required edits are applied and it builds.
.drafts/camera-in-your-dining-room.md
.drafts/india-sugar-price-rise-restaurants-2026.md
.drafts/lindt-two-lawsuits-what-your-menu-promises.md
